cal/tracker/publication failures and nonblocking ceremony warning remain unchanged. New F resolution runs must explicitly bind current04/05/Local plan/source README/checker versions.\\n\\nProceed S1/E through H continuously. Change only the exact final paragraph of docs/audits/README.md from the666\u002dbyte before to the813\u002dbyte after specified in v2 (after SHA256410e4432c01a38cda578a68fdaa730129c15a8e3e60c7305001bb40bd5a71b6c). It names paths/every\u002dsession behavior and cites bug1416. First record the new desired\u002dwording predicate refusing immutable D, then passing the candidate; commit actual source/proof before recording Resolved. Correct the two factual presentation errors with dated errata:95 occurrences/89 unique targets in active04/audit1417, and bug1416's old\u002dsource context17\u201320 rather than17\u201322. Original D records/readbacks stay preserved.\\n\\nUse separately named new E\u2013H guards/drivers and stage\u002de/f/g/h outputs; the17 frozen D tools cannot admit the README/retro or safely certify the new pre\u002dcommit state. All new files ordinary100644. Check every D\u2192tip commit plus staged index, working tree and untracked views independently. New refusals include index\u002donly unauthorized source, frozen artifact and wrong\u002dREADME changes hidden by restored working files, alongside the named history/scope/mode controls. Preserve all305 frozen D artifacts and29 transport representations/sidecars/manifest. No old producer, table/link/control/scan replay.\\n\\nAfter actual proof/commit, update the existing05 YAML and first Phase7 row to Resolved for the documentary correction, dated narratives and current tracker evidence. Both resolution lints and exact checked/open readbacks are required; \u002d\u002dissue lint alone does not certify checkbox state. Audit1417 and bug1416 remain OPEN at your handback. The18 #693 criteria remain untouched for root. No marker, source issue closure, other\u002downer disposition or actual integration.\\n\\nG posts the actual\u002ddate retro and exact readback. H is retained\u002donly: record the two D\u002dnamed owned roots and your new proof scratch with explicit limitations; delete nothing, perform no global process/host/cache census and retain ordinary publication packets. Return one clean published final tip with reviewed\u002dat/source, execution\u002dseed and actual fixed\u002dat, external exact\u002dfinal changed\u002drecord scan plus commit/push/remote/clean and tracker receipts. Stop for root simulation/final acceptance.\\n\\nAll commands/children CPUs8\u201323. Accepted T39/#686/#807/#346 integration, #1407 and #1414 remain separate. No source change beyond the exact README paragraph, historical rewrite, export/fetch/package evaluation, build/guest/runtime/provider/device/cloud/host\u002dledger action, cleanup or other\u002dagent permission answer. Report substantive progress or a concrete blocker; no intermediate approval relay is required. Can this be done on the VM? The source/record proof is documentary and host\u002dlocal; no runtime behavior is claimed or allocation needed.\"},{\"id\":6605168575,\"url\":\"https://github.com/pixelelated/distribution/issues/693#issuecomment\u002d6605168575\",\"body\":\"T46 S1/F substantive progress recorded, 2026\u002d11\u002d03 13:31 UTC.\\n\\nRoot independently read immutable commit45d455adccb0b2fc418f6442c4ca16a983430617: direct parent is accepted D a0d4c4fda7a0c16c04d57edf921ffeb741eff19b. The README is exactly813 bytes/SHA256410e4432c01a38cda578a68fdaa730129c15a8e3e60c7305001bb40bd5a71b6c; all305 frozen D artifacts have identical mode/blob records. The367 changed paths are confined to the authorized README and lane records. This check reads immutable content/metadata only; it does not rerun the lane's guard, controls or lints, or establish remote publication of this intermediate commit.\\n\\nT3 reports the desired\u002dwording old\u002dsource refusal/candidate positive, green pre\u002dS1 harness and