etained. v2 correctly maps ordinary non\u002dexecutable files to Git 100644. No old control was rerun. Final actual two\u002dcommit confinement passes with empty staged/working/untracked changes. All 305 frozen D files, 17 original tools and 29 transport records/sidecars/manifest remain exact.\\n\\nF: the existing 05 YAML outcome and first Phase7 row now say Resolved for this documentary correction; dated narrative addenda preserve the D finding and limitations. Both normal resolution lint and \u002d\u002dissue 1417 lint passed with explicit full current 04/05/Local\u002dplan/README/checker inputs. The final current harness in stage\u002dh/final\u002dgates passed all 12 commands plus its enumerated scan. Rules/register/index/checkbox/whitespace checks passed; the existing nonblocking ceremony cadence warning remains visible. Exact fresh final tracker readbacks show #1417 OPEN, one checked criterion, actual parent #693 and M6; #1416 OPEN, two checked criteria, no parent or milestone. All 18 #693 criteria remain unchanged and unchecked. No completion marker or issue closure.\\n\\nG: the actual\u002ddate retro is committed and posted at https://github.com/pixelelated/distribution/issues/693#issuecomment\u002d6605203841; exact body readback SHA256 25105181b4ee0944212bd32d68800d10747ad0d72ff07e0c8ecfd682d05cafef. It retains finite\u002dreading/metadata distinctions, masks/fallbacks, dated status, source/seed separation, transport/publication failures, the existing\u002drule reference correction and both unmeasured time\u002dto\u002dplay quantities.\\n\\nH: retained\u002donly NOFOLLOW census; nothing deleted:\\n\u002d /tmp/m6\u002dt46\u002dinputs.svbcPP \u2014 3 ordinary files / 7,447 logical bytes / 1 directory / 0 symlinks; metadata SHA256 5c121a76f10d1bb021c67d0cf6340edf1a3f92e4d474c6e1943c4a920b7aa055.\\n\u002d /tmp/m6\u002dt46\u002dconfinement\u002ds69_op77 \u2014 38 files / 29,410 bytes / 28 directories / 0 symlinks; SHA256 c1329f14195e3bed18f9e5b7fcf86f2dc39d197400