tain exact programs/inputs where applicable, argv/cwd/times/exits and lossless streams. The committed\u002dfile scan excludes its external receipts. The publication manifest explicitly excludes itself, its active recorder and later checkpoint/delivery records; those receive separate exact readbacks. No earlier snapshot is presented as final\u002dbyte proof.\\n\\nD acceptance limits remain unchanged: first 04/05 lint inputs were 8278/2482\u002dbyte prefixes, not final 8920/2807; later issue lint did not explicitly bind final 04/05. Pre\u002dseal 00/06 were 3846/3946\u002dbyte prefixes, not final 5007/5107. Root's separate 314\u002dfile D manifest supplies final\u002dbyte custody; 40 outside\u002daudit occurrences were not independently reopened by support, and current child hashes cannot reconstruct past input versions. Original failures, authorship and transports remain preserved.\\n\\nT39/#686/#807/#346 integration, #1407 and #1414 remain separate. No accepted producer replay, deletion, other\u002downer tree change, merge, source export/acquisition, package evaluation, runtime/host\u002dledger/provider/device/cloud action or permission answer occurred. Stopping at this published handback. Root retains exact\u002dtip simulation, final acceptance, completion marker, closure and actual ordered integration.\"},{\"id\":6605473056,\"url\":\"https://github.com/pixelelated/distribution/issues/693#issuecomment\u002d6605473056\",\"body\":\"Bounded T46 final\u002drecord reconciliation dispatch to P1 wN:p3; root retains simulation, disposition and acceptance.\\n\\nRead full #693 including final handback6605414149, audit1417/bug1416, immutable coordinator2aea545afb746ab002e755cf301f4aa89930e1e9:docs/reviews/briefs/t46\u002dstreams.md v2. Reuse your accepted D support under6604232125 and /tmp/m6\u002dt46\u002dd\u002dsupport\u002d9n7pqu00; do not repeat its source readings or historical producers.\\n\\nFinal lane17a064e6110306dd2b692cfd1b13d4f518d8def5; S1 45d455adccb0b2fc418f644